#! mathcas 2 notebook

#% title
# is_inexact

#% text
# `is_inexact(x)` gives `true` when `x` is an inexact number: a machine real or an arbitrary-precision ball, or a complex number with such parts.

#% section
# Examples

#% subsection
# Basic examples

#% cell
is_inexact(0.5)
#% output
#= true

#% cell
is_inexact(n(pi, 30))
#% output
#= true

#% cell
is_inexact(1/2)
#% output
#= false

#% section
# See also

#% text
# `is_exact`, `is_machine_number`, `precision`
